  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - 1.  The proposed extension, by reason of its size, position and appearance, would not preserve or enhance the character of Wellesley Road Conservation Area, contrary to policies ENV-B.1.1, ENV-B.2.2, H.6.4 and H.4.1 of the Council's Unitary Development Plan.\r\n2.  The proposed extension, by reason of its size, position and appearance, would detract from the appearance of the property, would unbalance the pair of semi-detached houses and would be unduly obtrusive and detrimental to the amenities of neighbouring residential properties or the street scene at Beaconsfield Close, contrary to policies ENV-B.1.1, ENV-B.2.2, H.6.4 and H.4.1 of the Council's Unitary Development Plan.\r\n"
